{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WARNING: StreetSync contains flashing images. If you experience epileptic seizures or blackouts when exposed to certain light patterns or flashing lights, immediately stop playing StreetSync and consult your doctor before resuming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/23ca8eb60e2ec09168fb35c3ae02bf35.poster.avif?t=1771916843\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/23ca8eb60e2ec09168fb35c3ae02bf35.webm?t=1771916843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/23ca8eb60e2ec09168fb35c3ae02bf35.mp4?t=1771916843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Shoot to your beat</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shoot to your custom beat. upload your track and add the Bpm to the song. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Change custom songs in-game using the pause menu. The feature will support .wav files. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master your own beats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/827e9f878a5e86cf8d6f1864676f7938.poster.avif?t=1771916843\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/827e9f878a5e86cf8d6f1864676f7938.webm?t=1771916843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/827e9f878a5e86cf8d6f1864676f7938.mp4?t=1771916843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Sync/Shoot</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You\u2019ll want some movement to go with that arsenal of yours.  You\u2019ve got to keep moving, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">if you want to survive, since the enemies will not just stare at you till, they die. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wall run, slide, double jump, ground slam, and dash your way through the streets to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">confuse your enemies. Don't Stop till you believe they're dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/2692a708af435624985dd2ec7e8f001b.poster.avif?t=1771916843\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/2692a708af435624985dd2ec7e8f001b.webm?t=1771916843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/2692a708af435624985dd2ec7e8f001b.mp4?t=1771916843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Sync/Repeat</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">StreetSync is a rogue-like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Parse through the vast procedurally generated levels, gain weapons and game changing </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">cards that will shift your playstyle. You will never guess what each run will have. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/89e1cf91f56b0c13c0e8de498cc764df.poster.avif?t=1771916843\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/89e1cf91f56b0c13c0e8de498cc764df.webm?t=1771916843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108670/extras/89e1cf91f56b0c13c0e8de498cc764df.mp4?t=1771916843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Features</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Fight Strong Bosses -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Equip a Strong arsenal -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Shooting to the beat -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Harness the rhythm using your own custom music -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Equip different cards that immensely alters gameplay -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Wall run, slide, double jump, ground slam, and dash your way through the streets -</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Underground\u2019s ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3108670/e2cb44d57daf96063ea2114c8bc4e24927bf7800.jpg"},{"name":"The Party","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3108670/73c569f5e5dc205b353bc003ccb2f4c5fe6dee7b.jpg"},{"name":"The Casino","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3108670/5bf8714b00e740f517df9484a4f4433fb64984e8.jpg"},{"name":"The Climb ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta